# The trial of pod-quic in podssh: podssh-relay keeps quick/quic.rs and
# quick/probe.rs as thin glue over pod-quic (the settings of the transport,
# the endpoint and its reset key, connect within the handshake's wait, the
# race of handshakes, the probe's packet, parser and race); server_name,
# alpn, connect_edge, EdgeConnection and the resolution of the regions of an
# edge stay in podssh. The role's QUIC (serve/quic.rs) takes pod-quic's
# TokenKey and endpoint. tests/quick_probe.rs leaves podssh (pod-quic's
# tests/probe.rs); the doctor's handshake tests stay, as they test podssh's
# regions. Each podcrates tag moves to the tag of the hand-off. The record
# with its citations, the repository checks; the builds of the default
# features and of the release's features; the checks of the features of
# the gate; clippy with the lints that the gate allows, with each feature of
# podssh-relay; the tests of podssh-relay and podssh-cli that run QUIC, the
# probe, the quick tunnel or the role's QUIC; rustfmt of the crates that the
# patch changes; each Rust toolchain of the workflows and build images
# against the rust-version of podcrates; the binary of the release's
# features for x86_64 musl, built with zig (a debug build: the release
# profile takes LTO), and podssh's static check of it.
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- remap Cargo.lock > /dev/null
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- check
python3 scripts/check-repo.py
cargo build -q
cargo check -q -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-core -p podssh-probe -p podssh-warp --features podssh-relay/blocking,podssh-relay/quick,podssh-relay/quic,podssh-relay/derp,podssh-relay/piping,podssh-relay/opentunnel,podssh-relay/code,podssh-relay/warp
cargo build -q -p podssh-cli --features iroh,warp
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-relay --all-features -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo test -q -p podssh-relay --all-features --lib --test quick_tunnel_quic --test quick_resilience --test relay_serve_quic --test quick_relay_quic --test quick_relay_probe --test quick_edge_warp --test quick_tunnel
cargo test -q -p podssh-cli --lib --test node_quick_relay --test doctor_ipv6
cargo fmt -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli --check
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-toolchains.py"
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-tests.py"
cargo zigbuild -q --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl -p podssh-cli --bin podssh --features "$(sed -n 's/^  RELEASE_FEATURES: //p' .github/workflows/release.yml)"
sh scripts/check-static.sh "${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/debug/podssh"
